e":"2014-01-19T22:22:46-08:00","id":53730,"title":"","content":"Perpetual college student. Every few years, she pacts with a different student. The trade? Money and knowledge for youth and station. Eidetic Memory makes keeping a B/C average easy, the college library is an excellent place for dead-drops, and freshmen can easily be induced to become cultists (Greek life, anybody?). Even away from campus, blue jeans, a university hoodie and a youthful appearance make you effectively invisible on the street.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1424-ghanjrho","name":"GhanjRho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1424_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-20T17:34:26-08:00","id":54345,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11519-ideas-for-covers?p=11621#post11621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Playboy millionaire.<br /> <br /> Your demonic form looks something like a gigantic flying chriopteran mammal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Philanthropist, genius?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-20T19:45:20-08:00","id":54426,"title":"","content":"my demon's current cover is an amnesiac.<br /> He healed a coma patient and soul-pacted them and claimed it immediately. That went something like, &quot;You have been chosen to aid in the fight against evil. We have given you life in exchange for everything you are, devote your soul to our cause.&quot;<br /> <br /> So he's transitioning back into normal life and if he doesn't know anyone, then it's not so odd.<br /> My plan is for him to attend support groups and make soul-pacts that way. Eventually, I'm hoping to run into some Hunters and play with fire a little bit as I fake being a hunter and pact with some of them. Turn these humans into an angel fighting squad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1930-rixx","name":"Rixx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T06:14:36-08:00","id":54626,"title":"","content":"my first Cover is inspired by the Will Graham character from the <i>Red Dragon</i> novels: an FBI special investigator serial killer profiler who is losing his mind. The Demon (Seraqael) is keeping things 'in place.'","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T09:50:22-08:00","id":54731,"title":"","content":"The abusive father/mother/husband/etc that had an epiphany and got into therapy and is really turning their life around. (I really like the idea of demons stealing the lives of fuckups and living them <i>better</i>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/996-gabby","name":"Gabby","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T10:08:55-08:00","id":54736,"title":"","content":"Creepy child. She used to have an imaginary friend, who sometimes told her to burn things or kill small animals, but she &quot;no longer believes in it&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T18:56:23-08:00","id":55110,"title":"","content":"Cult Leader?<br /> <br /> Or maybe founder of a revolutionary self-help program that teaches you how to conquer depression, anxiety and a host of other psycological/emotional issues without the use of traditional psychopharmacology and which is totally not a cult you guys and we will sue you if you keep saying that it is.(Spoiler alert, it's a cult.)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1591-freshman","name":"Freshman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1591_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T11:23:30-08:00","id":65828,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:15px\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wolfgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11519-ideas-for-covers?p=12087#post12087\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My take on a serial killer Cover is yes, you could kill without breaking Cover, and even would be required to kill to maintain Cover, but only within the context of a serial killer. Thus, you would have a highly ritualized killing style, a pattern of acting out, and preferred target group. Likewise if your Cover is a hitman you could kill targets you were paid to kill, and might have to to maintain Cover, but you would be restricted to those targets. Such Covers comes with enough complications anyway that it would likely not worth the trouble; angels are enough of a bitch without dealing with mundane law enforcement or the two working in tandem.</div> </div> </div> </div></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:15px\">You could pull a John Murdoch, i.e.: deep-cover Sword tasked with playing a Serial until one day, you Fell between victims (Undoubtly due to questioning the motives behind your crimes), now another Sword is pulling a double by taking over your mission while hunting you. So the game becomes a cat-&amp;-mouse chase to save, or possibly replace, the next victim, while both sides pit the authorities against each other. Bonus points if your Cipher relates to Hell being a concrete locale or a place you need to build for yourself.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T16:15:35-08:00","id":66044,"title":"","content":"I like the idea of a gang (cult) leader. Your gang gets some of their wishes to come true, and you get an army to distract the God-Machine from what you are really doing. I am also the fan of a reluctant G-M fighter, a fallen angel so into his/her Cover that they just want to be left alone to spend time with their family and live their life, but they keep getting pulled in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}